- pipeline/ingest.py is at 998 lines - do not edit it. Dispatch already fetches the base branch from origin (`pipeline/dispatch_worktree.py`, commit 123ebbe), so no dispatch change is needed.
- service.py may gain at most ~15 lines in total; keep the logic in remote_scope.py.

